{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "c2bb34b87f222dfc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He filled you with the glory of his likeness and his image."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "508b0563386c4634",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I am the one who will tell you about the honor of this feast today, because I understand more than you do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0110",
      "source_sha256": "56a58c3533dff9b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O Michael, you are the one who will teach all the ranks to serve me uprightly. Michael, you are the pride."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0131",
      "source_sha256": "8d2af6a030b5a4cb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But before bringing her to him, O Michael, if I had created Adam to remain alone—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0160",
      "source_sha256": "3e4baeeb8c452f95",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and all the good things of the world in my own hands."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0205",
      "source_sha256": "bb6ab9f704704c12",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I became poor, miserable, and without anyone, in great distress."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0211",
      "source_sha256": "3df7c548d9bcd6b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he cut down our enemies and led the way."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.000.0219",
      "source_sha256": "e36d62a6c54b6e23",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“How great is your joy today?” The judges said, “Truly, we rejoice today, because—”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0040",
      "source_sha256": "0f5e9301d8a1670b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I too am his priest. And my son John is the son of Elizabeth, who is a relative of Mary, the mother of Jesus, my relative by birth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0064",
      "source_sha256": "1343695f1d57a0f6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If not, [?] the king and his holy archangel Michael, the commander-in-chief who prevails in battles before his lord, who gives him all these honors because of his strength."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0069",
      "source_sha256": "e38698dcd73b4976",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or have you not heard about him, about the man who dared—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0076",
      "source_sha256": "d5f61d21cc75c701",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in addition to the rest of those who receive charity at the entrance to the courtyard. For the archangel whose feast you are celebrating is merciful."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0091",
      "source_sha256": "e635d545e92599b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you enter the church of God, which is the house of Michael—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0103",
      "source_sha256": "c9c17687236009d4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I tell you, my beloved, that what you will give to the person—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0109",
      "source_sha256": "fa11b51d47b704b6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "on the day of his appointment, and you neglect to take care of his offering and provide a service according to your ability. He will remain."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0111",
      "source_sha256": "9e827d27aebf92c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But perhaps, my beloved, you will say to me, “If I give charitable gifts and offerings, will I be giving them to God?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0116",
      "source_sha256": "9d2ac24e06ee9d70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And among these ranks you will find one higher than another, while the king is higher than them all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0125",
      "source_sha256": "6bb26ec80cb83b35",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and their charitable gifts, and he will give them to God like a great fragrant offering. He will receive an order from God concerning them, and he will prepare many good things for them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0143",
      "source_sha256": "d7e4db27d4074d77",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the widows, the orphans, and the strangers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0144",
      "source_sha256": "598a0af7082a2cef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and those whom they find, and they bring them into their homes, and both of them stand before them and serve them until they have finished eating."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0145",
      "source_sha256": "27fca4b2c7a26f84",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they give them plenty of wine."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0146",
      "source_sha256": "ef059f64f0acca82",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When they see them leaving, they anoint their heads with oil and send them off joyfully, saying, “Go in peace, beloved brothers.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0147",
      "source_sha256": "8ceb073ea731ac86",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For we have been found worthy of a great gift."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0153",
      "source_sha256": "f17aec0aadc5966d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now it happened, after a long time during which they continued in this way, that God gave an order."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0186",
      "source_sha256": "83a37e646817984a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For look, O our protector, you see the humiliation that has come upon us as repayment for our sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0191",
      "source_sha256": "287f94e59bc92f73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you are not far from those who call upon you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.001.0202",
      "source_sha256": "c8c7123216edb1c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The holy and truly faithful man went to his wife."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0023",
      "source_sha256": "087ee531fd2eb9ca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And set out the table and the bread."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0024",
      "source_sha256": "e0347f7cb04a27b5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Take care of the vegetables until I return, God willing, with the sheep."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0033",
      "source_sha256": "d8ad7320d88f9422",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If I do not bring it to you, I relinquish it to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0040",
      "source_sha256": "47e1c0dce8d1f484",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The man was very frightened and moved aside, off the road, until he passed by."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0061",
      "source_sha256": "058e8d00f47c9c2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the needs of the important man whom you invited."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0068",
      "source_sha256": "d2e1b70b4a66a469",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The ruler, who was Michael, said to him, “If this is what you have decided, I myself will send in my name and take the fish until you send its price.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0072",
      "source_sha256": "6879e4ac9a1a2cfa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I will send you its price through Dorotheus the farmer by noon today."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0091",
      "source_sha256": "61599c6e17690215",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Michael said to her, “Greetings, Theopiste”—which means “she who believes in God”—“How are you doing these days?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0119",
      "source_sha256": "f6dfd281b1346938",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to her, “Be patient, my sister, until we see how the matter ends.” Afterward he said to her, “Let us go and bring out the little bit of oil.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0131",
      "source_sha256": "cd90905a9573327c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, God has equipped us in every respect. Let us spread it out for the ruler."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0143",
      "source_sha256": "9dc740b225a592b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you quickly sent us your mercies."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0144",
      "source_sha256": "9f179cc110f4eaa1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then, after these things, they gathered together and received the greeting of peace."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0180",
      "source_sha256": "1f074e4a202df56d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They found a large cloth inside it, sealed with a seal."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0192",
      "source_sha256": "b8a6c89c076204fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He raised his eyes to heaven, saying, “You are righteous, Lord, and your judgments are upright, and there is no limit to those who love you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0206",
      "source_sha256": "a48eab0ad54fa98f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now Dorotheus and Theopiste his wife."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0224",
      "source_sha256": "a48eab0ad54fa98f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now Dorotheus and Theopiste his wife."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0242",
      "source_sha256": "7353daa1bb252e3d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When you come to the royal city, he will repay them to you with their interest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.002.0277",
      "source_sha256": "73ec4744bf446213",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Because it was baptism that he had received through Peter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0048",
      "source_sha256": "a4ef082ef186d02f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God, in turn, will feed you with the bread of life in heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0055",
      "source_sha256": "5502cac3e194c10a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you go to visit someone who is very sick."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0056",
      "source_sha256": "13b311337fc039a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On the day of the holy archangel Michael."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0064",
      "source_sha256": "269273fef6647866",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God, in turn, will have mercy on you and heal you of the wounds of hell, for it is written, “Blessed are the merciful, for they are the ones who will [?].”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0076",
      "source_sha256": "747a43bcaaa3c973",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He forgave them their transgression."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0099",
      "source_sha256": "94b3d723cf289478",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He added another ten years to the hundred years of his life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0104",
      "source_sha256": "499bc4e6718075ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Through the prayers of Michael and his entire host. It was also an act of mercy that God performed for our fathers the apostles: he chose them, nor [?] the whole world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0119",
      "source_sha256": "2b362e15fde4b6fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us therefore leave behind the works of darkness at the feast of the archangel Michael."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0127",
      "source_sha256": "3dcebbcbf35d22d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The archangel petitions God on our behalf, so that he may provide us with our food and clothing according to his will."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0153",
      "source_sha256": "1ec7a46c2498bed6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is written: “The place where two or three ...”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.003.0199",
      "source_sha256": "45a5ae3978bfabd2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A kingdom and a priesthood, a holy nation, a people for life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0001",
      "source_sha256": "3ca22d649c0d70f1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Honored in every way, Apa Theodosius, the archbishop of Alexandria, who delivered it at the feast of the holy archangel Michael, which is the twelfth day of the month of Hathor. He delivered many compositions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0056",
      "source_sha256": "5dca671a58ed102f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Into the openings only, so that the wind blows into them and carries them out to the open sea."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0072",
      "source_sha256": "8ac9937199465d2b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I will tell you, brothers, what the vessel is."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0081",
      "source_sha256": "5895b377265e7fea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Rather, he is one from heaven. He is not a fleshly human being like us, but an angel of light. He is not a creature of the earth, but a creature from a holy spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0083",
      "source_sha256": "845dc2fed5adff72",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Rather, he is a minister of a flame of fire. He is not an earthly ruler who will pass away, but an archangel in the heavens. He is not an earthly commander-in-chief who will be dismissed, whom the king replaces whenever he wishes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.004.0112",
      "source_sha256": "4db21a9ed7fe4c47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you will certainly say to me:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0041",
      "source_sha256": "f0c68642a7a0eb30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one to whom all these things happened—I will answer him too."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0066",
      "source_sha256": "4b41c93bb6e6a521",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The merciful God said to him again: “Satanael, listen to me. I am your Lord. I am your creator. Come now and bow down to the work of my hands.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0068",
      "source_sha256": "b8b62bedf07e5383",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“We must never bow down to one who is inferior to us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0078",
      "source_sha256": "e849f0ef1b144bf4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Listen to me now. Come and bow down to the creature I have formed.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0080",
      "source_sha256": "794b31b96b09d051",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I and my entire host—my entire host especially—and the one who is greater than I.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0095",
      "source_sha256": "59c3d18120549b35",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I, in turn, will also direct my favor toward you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0096",
      "source_sha256": "6db9115d557e9e19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And they opened your mouth, Michael, so that you might receive all my mercies within you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0097",
      "source_sha256": "fec4f6b981386a57",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“So that you will continue petitioning me at all times on behalf of my likeness and my image. I too will look.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0098",
      "source_sha256": "f3ee3bdfba85523a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“For I know that Mastema will quarrel with the creatures I have formed, wanting to cast them away from me, just as I cast him out of my kingdom.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0099",
      "source_sha256": "58f5c9b24e24100d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“But look, I have entrusted you with the creatures I have formed, so that you may save them from his snares.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0101",
      "source_sha256": "565b975301715698",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Today I appoint you commander-in-chief of all the hosts of heaven.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0127",
      "source_sha256": "1cc977651874d562",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“You are the ruler of those in heaven and those [?].”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0132",
      "source_sha256": "6eab28f79b2b4369",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the Lord had said all these things to Michael,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0134",
      "source_sha256": "cf5b5ec89a74f722",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he placed the crown on him and made him an archangel. He placed three seals upon him in the form of the Holy Trinity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0139",
      "source_sha256": "747a43bcaaa3c973",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He forgave them their transgression."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0180",
      "source_sha256": "4bf43ad19cc41196",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] he said, “I rejoice today because I am the first person whom Michael has clothed, together with my Lord and his other companion, the archangel Gabriel.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0187",
      "source_sha256": "5236b8bbb163d56c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why are you dressed up like this?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0192",
      "source_sha256": "8565148aa3802def",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He lifted me onto a rock on a deserted mountain."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.005.0212",
      "source_sha256": "afaf8f4ea4d81d8a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I became poor, miserable, and alone, in great distress."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0002",
      "source_sha256": "38c5e2cfb82e1ca4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The holy archangel Michael pleaded with the one who lives forever."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0008",
      "source_sha256": "a2f83300037a90c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I am leaping,” he said, “and rejoicing because Michael, the great archangel…”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0035",
      "source_sha256": "91be508c3cc6a08d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His son also rejoiced at the festival of the holy archangel Michael."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0075",
      "source_sha256": "0b7431471edcb920",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Did you not hear him saying, “Do not come in”?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0133",
      "source_sha256": "aefca2c4e4603c10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "To him, knowing that his rank is great."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0139",
      "source_sha256": "67da1a68e4082a25",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And that he may receive them graciously before God, and they may be free from punishment forever."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0176",
      "source_sha256": "e9c09a9123cf204a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Because no water had come upon [?] for three consecutive years."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0203",
      "source_sha256": "262656fda1faac36",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now we appeal to you, Michael, our good protector: if indeed this great [?] is upon us at our end, and these covenants that we made with you and with God, not to neglect your sacrifice and your love feast."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0233",
      "source_sha256": "3da02759ccfcfa7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The holy man set out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.006.0236",
      "source_sha256": "acf7a42597de328a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Sit down [?]. Do I know what festival is tomorrow?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0016",
      "source_sha256": "687b3c948e637391",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Do I not have a share with you in the sacrifices?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0032",
      "source_sha256": "959b2ffd32fca25c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The shepherd said to him, “They have come [?] the price that I gave you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0033",
      "source_sha256": "70fd20525ced996d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The man held out his wife’s tunic to him, saying, “Here is the tunic.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0061",
      "source_sha256": "3400fb334a3f05bd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“They did not take it from me. I do not know what I will do.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0081",
      "source_sha256": "f1080569a6151b4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And I will send you its price.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0093",
      "source_sha256": "608fb233e6d91151",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They took the sheep and the fish."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0096",
      "source_sha256": "8c75800679e045eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And where would he find clothing and wine for the governor’s needs?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0213",
      "source_sha256": "7cbe12b76376033a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Dorotheus opened it and found a large cloth inside it, sealed with a seal."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0236",
      "source_sha256": "28f468f074382ef9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And take the other three tremissis coins for yourselves, and give one to the shepherd.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0253",
      "source_sha256": "3cae17767640ee12",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And we will redeem the tunic for the offering, according to your command.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0255",
      "source_sha256": "e92ef067ab2fc8dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And perhaps you will be afraid, lest the king [?].”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.007.0323",
      "source_sha256": "3ea484f0246e4241",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And when you depart from this life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0016",
      "source_sha256": "e1a87f68dc0450e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Dorotheus, however, and Theopiste, his wife."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0048",
      "source_sha256": "aad2859201a8bc4b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Father, make an effort to give to God on the feast of the holy archangel Michael."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0068",
      "source_sha256": "824e0e6164aeaa8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "God, in turn, will build you a house in heaven, not made by hands."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0084",
      "source_sha256": "8e7e38a9589d1486",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "He accepted his offering from him through Michael’s prayers. It was also an act of mercy that God performed for Enoch: he took him away so that he would not see death, through the prayers of Michael and his host. It was also an act of love that God performed for Noah."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0095",
      "source_sha256": "9e8b46acec4d0d06",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Through the prayers of Michael and his host. An act of love, too."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/theodosius_alexandria#CopScr.theodosius-alexandria.008.0143",
      "source_sha256": "be6b44bb8a5aea79",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
